  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Innovation through exchange of best practices on Intellectual Property Rights (IPR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity agreement has been developed in a joint effort between the Colombian Intellectual Property Office (SIC), the Danish Patent and Trademark Office (DKPTO) and the Danish Embassy in Bogota.  It falls within the remit of an MoU, signed between the Danish Embassy and the Colombian Ministry of Health, which seeks, amongst other things, to encourage technical cooperation and the sharing of best practices between Colombia and Denmark.</narrative>
  </description>
